# ⛔ NO CAMERA-RIG CAPTURES IN THIS REPO. IT IS PUBLIC.
#
# Every rig photo shows the room behind the HUD, so they do not belong in a public repo at all --
# not at the root, and not curated into docs/proof/ either. Keep them local and DESCRIBE what they
# show in prose (STATUS.md, a commit message); the measurable evidence -- ret= masks, ACK codes,
# the firmware's page verdict -- is text and belongs in the record anyway.
#
# The previous rule here named four filename patterns (/hud*.png, /os[0-9]*.png, ...), but
# hud-probe.ps1 writes whatever `-Out` is given, so it could only ever catch captures that happened
# to be called hud*. 120 photos (85MB) reached the public repo through that gap and had to be
# purged from history on 2026-08-09. Hence a denylist of the whole file type, with explicit
# exceptions, rather than a list of names nobody will remember to extend.
#
# To commit an image DELIBERATELY: put it under an excepted path, or add a `!` line -- and if it is
# a photograph, put it in a PRIVATE repo instead.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
!assets/**
!tools/g2sim/**
